OL,5,G1830 Home and Away
OL,6,     FAbigail drums up a girls' night.
OL,7,     FJustin puts his foot in it.
OL,8,     FDavid's eyes are opened.
OL,9,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,10,     FAt Bradford's Ridge Medical
OL,11,     FPractice, baby Imaan is suffering
OL,12,     Fsevere nappy rash, Aris has been
OL,13,     Fleaking yellow fluid from a cyst
OL,14,     Fin his armpit, and Gemma has a
OL,15,     Fworrying tongue ulcer.
OL,16,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,17,     FStaff at Barnsley Casualty again
OL,18,     Fface life and death, trauma and
OL,19,     Ftears. Sam arrives with serious
OL,20,     Fburns, needing to be doused with
OL,21,     Fwater to stop the burns spreading.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
