OL,5,G2100 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,6,     FA man's hand is caught in an
OL,7,     Findustrial machine, crushing it,
OL,8,     Fand threatening his life when it
OL,9,     Fproves impossible to get the
OL,10,     Fdevice to release.
OL,11,G2200 A&E After Dark
OL,12,     FNighshift staff deal with
OL,13,     Fdrunkenness in the cubicles, the
OL,14,     Fvictim of a dog attack who might
OL,15,     Fhave a tooth in the wound, and a
OL,16,     Fpatient brought into resus via
OL,17,     Fambulance in a diabetic coma.
